WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:04.037
-Guys, tonight is
our 1,500th show.

00:00:04.037 --> 00:00:06.339
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:06.339 --> 00:00:08.774
In honor of that, something
special is about to happen.

00:00:08.774 --> 00:00:10.944
Years ago, we had an idea
for a bit

00:00:10.944 --> 00:00:12.678
called
"Straight Up Goes For It."

00:00:12.678 --> 00:00:14.113
It was a simple idea.

00:00:14.113 --> 00:00:16.750
We wanted somebody to come out
and straight-up sing

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:20.219
"Drops of Jupiter"
by the band Train.

00:00:20.219 --> 00:00:21.787
That's it.

00:00:21.787 --> 00:00:24.190
That's the whole idea.

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:26.059
This sketch has been
our white whale.

00:00:26.059 --> 00:00:28.394
We've been pitching it
for years,

00:00:28.394 --> 00:00:29.996
to dozens of people,

00:00:29.996 --> 00:00:32.398
famous people that
you know and love,

00:00:32.398 --> 00:00:35.601
both singers --
they sing in movies --

00:00:35.601 --> 00:00:38.937
they dance, they sing, and
they actually have music out.

00:00:38.937 --> 00:00:40.373
They all passed on it.

00:00:40.373 --> 00:00:41.474
[ Laughing ]

00:00:41.474 --> 00:00:42.808
But not tonight.

00:00:42.808 --> 00:00:44.244
Tonight, that changes,

00:00:44.244 --> 00:00:49.415
because we finally have someone
who has the guts to do it.

00:00:49.415 --> 00:00:54.987
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:54.987 --> 00:00:56.990
He doesn't play the piano,
by the way.

00:00:56.990 --> 00:00:58.624
[ Laughing ]

00:00:58.624 --> 00:01:00.793
And he doesn't even really
know how to sing.

00:01:00.793 --> 00:01:03.495
But he's doing it
because he's cool,

00:01:03.495 --> 00:01:05.665
and he's funny, and he gets it.

00:01:05.665 --> 00:01:08.567
So now, ladies and gentlemen,
I present to you,

00:01:08.567 --> 00:01:10.069
Kit Harington
Straight Up Goes For It.

00:01:10.069 --> 00:01:12.172
[ Applause ]

00:01:12.172 --> 00:01:15.074
[ "Drops of Jupiter" plays ]

